  "methodology": [
    "Four launches in control/candidate/control/candidate order, same signed diagnostic APK, same app profile and unchanged gameplay assets. Process stopped between trials; filesystem cache was not forcibly cleared.",
    "Primary metric sums measured GameAPP.Awake and GameAPP.Start durations; nested phase timings must not be added again.",
    "Secondary wall metric includes launch dispatch, readiness polling, first five-second frame sample, and dumpsys memory snapshot; it is not an exact interactable-menu timer.",
    "PSS snapshots are taken after startup and before loading deferred menus. Later opening all menus can consume the deferred memory.",
    "Baseline and candidate retain the original game startup/assets except the candidate UI constructor/Push interception. The original Push/pop/navigation functions are used."
  ],
